Canonical Source Map
Master System Blueprint
Architectural Laws
Risk
Autonomy
Approval
Evidence
Data Classification
Time Semantics
Notification Governance
Solo-Founder Operating Model
```

Rule:

```text
CROSS-SYSTEM
→ /docs/
```

